  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed extension, by reason of its size, depth, height and siting in relation to the adjoining properties at Nos. 28 and 32 Gordon Road, would appear unduly dominant and overbearing and would result in a harmful loss of outlook and an increased sense of enclosure for the occupiers of those properties. The proposal would therefore have an unacceptable impact on the amenity of the adjoining premises for the purposes of paragraph A.4 of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) and Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy 4 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD11 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
